      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laurel_Mountain%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1939 Rolling Rock opened a private ski area that later became the first major ski resort in western Pennsylvania, earning the nickname “Ski Capital of Pennsylvania.”.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
